l-72\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"pt-20 px-8 py-space-md bg-surface\"\u003e\u003cnav class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\u003ca class=\"hover:text-on-surface transition-colors\" data-path=\"trang-chu\" href=\"#\"\u003eTrang chủ\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[14px]\"\u003echevron_right\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"text-on-surface font-medium\"\u003eTài khoản của tôi\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/nav\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cmain class=\"relative w-full px-8 pb-space-xl bg-surface min-h-[calc(100vh-20rem)]\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col w-full gap-space-lg\"\u003e\n\u003c!-- Toast / Ambient Notification --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"transition-all duration-300 transform opacity-0 -translate-y-2 pointer-events-none hidden bg-surface-container-highest px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-xl shadow-md flex items-center justify-between gap-space-md\" id=\"saveToast\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-sm text-primary\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]\"\u003everified\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg text-on-surface\"\u003eĐã cập nhật hồ sơ cá nhân thành công! Dữ liệu đã đồng bộ sang FANFUN Care.\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cbutton class=\"text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface\" onclick=\"dismissToast()\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]\"\u003eclose\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/button\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Header & Meta Level --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row lg:items-center justify-between gap-space-md bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-sm relative overflow-hidden\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"absolute -right-16 -top-16 w-56 h-56 rounded-full bg-primary/5 pointer-events-none blur-2xl\"\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-col gap-space-xs z-10\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm uppercase tracking-wider text-primary font-bold\"\u003eTài khoản &amp; Bảo hành\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-outline text-xs\"\u003e•\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-sm text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\"\u003eCập nhật lần cuối: 2 giờ trước\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface tracking-tight\"\u003eHồ sơ của tôi\u003c/h1\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-2xl\"\u003e\n        Quản lý thông tin hồ sơ để bảo mật tài khoản và đồng bộ quyền lợi bảo hành chính hãng FANFUN Care.\n      \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Quick Meta Chips --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex flex-wrap lg:flex-col items-start lg:items-end gap-space-sm z-10\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed-variant shadow-sm\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[18px] text-primary\" style=\"font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 1;\"\u003eworkspace_premium\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-lg text-label-lg font-bold\"\u003eThành viên Gold\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"text-on-primary-fixed-variant/60 font-body-sm text-body-sm\"\u003e|\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-md text-label-md font-semibold\"\u003e1.029 pts\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-xs rounded-full bg-surface-container text-on-surface-variant\"\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-primary\"\u003everified_user\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003cspan class=\"font-label-md text-label-md font-medium\"\u003eĐã xác thực số điện thoại &amp; email\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c!-- Smart Sync Banner --\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"bg-surface-container-low p